        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per encounter</p><hr /><p>Creatures in a <strong>15-foot emanation</strong> must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or be <strong>dazzled</strong> for 1 round. At Magnesium Depth 3 a failure is <strong>blinded</strong> instead, and the flare deals fire damage equal to your level to creatures with light sensitivity or light blindness. At Depth 4 the emanation is 30 feet and counteracts magical darkness; once per day it may instead heal each ally within it for your level.</p>"
        },
